# data/exact.bin read whole, byte for byte, by Ropes.ReadFile: a CR
# before a line feed, a form feed, a 0X, and no line feed at the end --
# each of which a line-by-line read (lines, via Ropes.ReadLineRider) would
# lose or change.  Printed as its length, a space, and its contents
# escaped, so every byte shows.  The same data file and expected output
# as the Ada Ropes port's rope-readfile.test.
program RopeTool
arg readfile
arg tests/data/exact.bin
status 0
output
36 one\r\ntwo\012three\000four\nno final newline
